{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10011_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c1329ce8cfaa8a60ed1cba29bd3bd4095c405f67f380a296dc3bea3f812c4402",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6abd338365caf2354127b1cc55c628c3eb3cc878f481e50e39dc10ca2b49d46",
      "text": "按照冬马先生的期望，我们已经拜托认识的乐队\n来担任Jupiter的现场伴奏乐队了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5bd6ca7715ee7c45aee221d1c5544c19e2fb12fc686d47e725810890fd3d7a0",
      "text": "对方很痛快地接受了邀约！\n大家都非常有干劲哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a556e813fba1c95f85f291b64c6a30438a43ecf5314f9d8cb2dc9a3c932210b3",
      "text": "谢啦，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c31757e04683765c172d4c7dc5c1bc0c85f724a5a69649e820f96204c636e525",
      "text": "按照日程来看，跟乐队成员\n合排的机会没那么多呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70bba1bac74d622e1c1cad9471148f72a21f123c936e3abe4d1a4a98d28645fb",
      "text": "在联合练习之前，把表演水平提升上去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d1750c5772367a8dc6f688812d57bb35cc4ca10d5e36965d350fba4e231a6d3",
      "text": "对我们偶像来说摇滚音乐节正是客场，\n所以才更要比平时更燃起来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:495e6f579090343d20fd978f33f828caec95d4c94580fe32d9c58d2e23665e40",
      "text": "冬马，太急于求成的话，\n能看见的东西也会变得看不见的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:614553aa126d187c8689b274dbcc30131da3c4a23f8a7b61d3f89fa8aa3d831e",
      "text": "就是就是，稍微冷静一点嘛～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33f4c870aaf213f9966b292371d4e501774bac1f70ebafa865b94d229c5c9b64",
      "text": "搞什么嘛……\n你们不也干劲十足吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96663f9105bad8f4394a628f93d10ea2f3d12d4f5736c197f5711712f5831dda",
      "text": "是啊，虽然观众里的女性可能比平时少，\n但必须展现出帅气的一面才行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd85f7c1fb6bdad4b306330b18b74e1204a7bbefe51a73ad9e7f2ba850fb0495",
      "text": "还是老样子呢，北斗君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000111:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000124:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36f363777c1db9769f6910228b817b35c1769fd524489d55d53e8dbaf1b1cc28",
      "text": "找朋友借来了\n乐队的演出DVD",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000126:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97d7de33ffef321d0d76da080156a096be2efeb4e285b3422bcd8ffabd69d60a",
      "text": "大家一起看，\n当做音乐节的参考吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000128:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ee25ef05a5cfc389503090cf87de3b7adad1802d9006c528f2ef61c9beea78c",
      "text": "当然没问题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000130:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59c55d4b878df63d50ff372587f8319ae3821c1cf3fe8c6bce31cf184b4a7c34",
      "text": "我知道了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000130:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04f476becff7df99265a406b881b473c6507a0723d06d74ce94f3d9500d10778",
      "text": "我知道了！\n明天练习之前\n一起看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000133:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ad8de0955bd39b03755233fda396ee5ad98138ca2afd2e7cc8eee326c50a610",
      "text": "诶——？\n怎么办好呢～<emoji>image_talk_emoji_08</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000135:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:241b93b7f7a7d650ed94f559742f46c622fcb77d02b364a2c6f77c97e3b6d688",
      "text": "搞什么，你不想看吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000137:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ecdb2f77ea79a27dda653295e973f2440d7d1583f42ed84aeb211da35cea57b",
      "text": "要是有冬马君的便当的话～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000139:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a38a49f2c6923dacdb23d008a8f9c0670074e990746c30a4a5064317cb328d9b",
      "text": "要是有装满了好多我爱吃的菜\n的便当，说不定\n就涌出干劲了呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000142:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:369e7c46eb18b42cea8072615fb59d41680fd474a2d45f1738eeaf190323451e",
      "text": "你小子，\n纯粹就是想说这个吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000144:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed37718b86a56cd11c0bfcc81e0c7673f2eb7e56457ab4bb656fb5c2cf0e530e",
      "text": "知道了啦，相对的\n你要陪我去买菜啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000146:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71eeea73a454c387c533a6b243a6eae747039070f4011f7afc1fe666a4d8731e",
      "text": "北斗和制作人的份\n我也一起做了吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000148:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2748f98b581d6a0e55e73e8a9f986d33f92b9547a36b5f0595cb7904318639b3",
      "text": "很期待哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000148:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:652d8dce3f4ebde0adf49521741688aac1095f6f17669492df647273843212b4",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n我很期待便当哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000149:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:319a0fff36001f44195970b32883cf68a22daf87049b2fed695cbfb18b73935f",
      "text": "我来帮忙采购",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000149:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad1f1a9746f2cd056de31cbf98050ad8343597f6a5a77d20cc7217347bd85ffc",
      "text": "那样的话，\n我也来帮忙采购吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000152:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5b20dbf03c04583c34840757f14deaaf5b7b782796ba7738947d3d5e6d6cf8f",
      "text": "噢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000157:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9e235996eef028b5bfcb0815d96ab9f21dd8589c2c114d62f20847d38788ace",
      "text": "我让北斗和翔太帮忙就行，\n制作人等着就好",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_e:cmd-000159:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af006d8c77ef944f72febb5dd9f117675886cb87ceb4fe23b5f51151e647b9f8",
      "text": "那就敬请期待明天的\n成果吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
